The topic of jbocradi - lobjan podcast came up on irc today and I'd like to
invite all interested to join in. We're brainstorming at
http://etherpad.com/1NFPUj3vsE which is a sort of multiplayer notepad. Just
add your thoughts to there. In particular we need someone to take charge of
the project and do the main recording. My microphone isn't good enough, so
I'll do snippets, say a poetry reading, but not the main bit. If you want to
get involved, but consider your voice appaling, haven't a mic, then we need
people brainstorming at the address above. We also need someone to trawl
http://music.mevio.com/ for music to use between sections.

Please let's get the podcast up and running again this time!

mu'o mi'e cmacis

